        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pau e Pedra is a small-scale, casual battle royale focused on quick matches and lighthearted multiplayer sessions with friends. There are no complex systems, no deep progression trees — just simple, fast gameplay where players pick up whatever they find on the ground and try to be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is minimal and intentionally straightforward: punch with your fists, grab a stick to hit harder, or throw a rock to catch someone off guard. It's easy to learn, fast to play, and ideal for short bursts of chaotic fun with a group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with multiplayer in mind, Pau e Pedra offers a clean and responsive experience without the usual complexity of the genre. It’s a simple game made for good times.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pau e Pedra is a small-scale, casual battle royale focused on quick matches and lighthearted multiplayer sessions with friends. There are no complex systems, no deep progression trees — just simple, fast gameplay where players pick up whatever they find on the ground and try to be the last one standing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Combat is minimal and intentionally straightforward: punch with your fists, grab a stick to hit harder, or throw a rock to catch someone off guard. It's easy to learn, fast to play, and ideal for short bursts of chaotic fun with a group.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Built with multiplayer in mind, Pau e Pedra offers a clean and responsive experience without the usual complexity of the genre. It’s a simple game made for good times.</p>",
